'''Damilara Sunsorrow''' is a hunter trainer located in [[Alah'Thalas]], beneath the translocation orb leading to the Golden Dawn Institute. Following the fall of Silvermoon and the establishment of the [[Silvermoon Remnant]], Damilara held the position of Ranger-General under the leadership of Speaker [[Vereesa Windrunner]] until the resettlement of the [[Thalassian Highlands]] and the formation of the [[Regency Council]], after which the position was granted to [[Halduron Brightwing]].

